      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:3:1:7:5",
      "text": [
        " سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) عَنْ سُؤْرِ الْيَهُودِيِّ وَ النَّصْرَانِيِّ فَقَالَ لَا ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from his father, from Abdullah Bin Al Mugheira, from Saeed Al A’araj who said, ",
          "‘I asked Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> about the residue of (the water drunk by) the Jew and Christian, so he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘No’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "5. Ali ibn Ibrahim has narrated from his father from ‘Abd Allah ibn al-Mughirah from Sa‘id al-‘Araj who has said the following: “I once asked abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, about the leftover of Jews and Christians. He (the Imam) said, ‘No.  "
        ]
      }
    },
